	)
	(text "MAX2871 NOTES (DS Rev 4)\n- One 1u 10V X5R 0402 on every supply pin (C607-C609, C611-C613), branch caps C602/C603 and NOISE_FILT/BIAS_FILT/REG (C614-C616).\n  Place each 1u directly at its pin, own GND via at or in the pad. Check the part's DC-bias curve at 3.3V; no Y5V.\n- C610: C0G 0402 on VCC_RF, series-resonant at 5.8 GHz when mounted (~1-3 pF, from vendor S-params), closest to pin 16.\n- C618-C621 DC blocks: 0402 C0G near series resonance at 5.8 GHz. R605-R607 47R series: place at the ESP32 end.\n- R608/R609 100k hold CE/RFOUT_EN low at boot.\n- Loop filter C622/R616/C623/R617/C624 = MAX2871 DS Rev 4 TOC table \"6.0 GHz closed-loop\n  phase noise\" config: fREF 50 MHz, fPFD 25 MHz, ~40 kHz BW, CP[3:0]=1111 (5.12 mA w/ RSET 5k1),\n  integer N=240. Ours: N=232 @ fPFD 25 MHz. Confirm Kvco @ 5.8 GHz in ADIsimPLL. All loop-filter caps C0G/film.\n- Firmware: program all regs twice at power-up (>=20 ms gap, order 5..0), RFA_EN/RFB_EN = 0 until second\n  pass; set MTLD=1 (reg4 b10) and MUTEDEL=1 (reg3 b17) so outputs mute when unlocked. PDP=1.\n- VCC_VCO on dedicated branch +3V3_SYN_VCO (R618). Pull-up node HF caps C626/C627 C0G series-resonant.\n- R612 (50R term) or J602 (SMA monitor): populate one. J601/J602: Molex 73251-1153 edge-launch SMA.\n- Bead-free star: R601-R603 0R 0603 branch links (fallback filter footprints). R604 10R + C604 10u = TCXO RC, fc ~1.6 kHz.\n- +3V3_SYN from dedicated low-noise LDO (TBD); LC/pi filter at LDO input if fed from a switcher. REF_25M from TCXO (TBD).\n- GND pins 8,9,11,18,21,27,31: own via each, not to EP. EP: >=9-via array."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 96.52 222.25 0)
